{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42979","headline":"还渭南感旧二首 二 · 唐暄","name":"还渭南感旧二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常时华室静，笑语度更筹。\n恍惚人事改，冥漠委荒丘。\n阳原叹薤露，阴壑悼藏舟。\n清夜妆台月，空想画眉愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐暄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}